      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Sure thing! Here's a 4-week strength program for a beginner, focusing on squats, bench presses, and deadlifts. Remember, it's important to start with lighter weights and gradually increase the load as you progress. Don't forget to rest and recover properly between workouts, and always listen to your body to avoid injury. Now, let's get started!\n\nWeek 1:\n- Squats: 3 sets of 8 reps (light weight)\n- Bench Press: 3 sets of 8 reps (light weight)\n- Deadlifts: 3 sets of 8 reps (light weight)\n\nWeek 2:\n- Squats: 3 sets of 10 reps (slightly heavier weight)\n- Bench Press: 3 sets of 10 reps (slightly heavier weight)\n- Deadlifts: 3 sets of 10 reps (slightly heavier weight)\n\nWeek 3:\n- Squats: 3 sets of 12 reps (moderate weight)\n- Bench Press: 3 sets of 12 reps (moderate weight)\n- Deadlifts: 3 sets of 12 reps (moderate weight)\n\nWeek 4:\n- Squats: 3 sets of 15 reps (heavier weight)",
