      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, that helps. i guess i'm just worried that the fatigue will feel like it's coming from outside of me, like some kind of weird distraction or something pulling at me while i'm lifting. is there a way to deal with those kinds of intrusive, nagging thoughts that make you want to just give up halfway through?",
